  "onboardingIntroPage1Title": "A diary that stays on this device",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item0": "Your diary is stored encrypted on this device.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item1": "No account, no ads, and no behavioral tracking.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item2": "Protect it with a password or biometrics, and lock automatically after a while away.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Title": "You decide how you write",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item0": "Write plain text, or use Markdown, checklists, photos, and files.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item1": "Want to sort out your thoughts first? Talk with AI, then turn the chat into one diary entry.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item2": "AI receives content only when you ask it to generate or organize, and only to the provider you set up. Nothing is saved until you confirm.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Title": "Connect memories with tags and people",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item0": "Sort entries with colored tags, then find related ones from the Tags page.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item1": "Keep names and relationships in People, type @ to mention someone, and build an AI persona for them.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item2": "Look back from different angles with the timeline, calendar, search, or Overview.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Title": "You decide when to back up",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item0": "A full backup keeps your entries encrypted. Save it as a file or in Google Drive.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item1": "You create backups yourself. They do not sync automatically.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item2": "Exported Markdown or HTML is not encrypted, so keep those files safe.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Title": "Your recovery key is your spare key",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item0": "Creating a new diary generates a recovery key. Keep a copy somewhere else.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item1": "You need this key to restore on a new device or after reinstalling.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item2": "Neither the app nor the developer keeps a copy. If it is lost, your diary cannot be recovered.",
